## macOS / Xcode (mac/ContentGuard.xcodeproj and friends)
# The .xcodeproj itself (project.pbxproj) IS committed - that's the shared
# project definition. Everything below is per-machine/per-user churn that
# shouldn't be, same reasoning as .idea/ above for Android Studio.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcscmblueprint
*.xccheckout
DerivedData/
mac/build/
mac/Installer/pkg-root/
mac/Installer/*.pkg

## worker/ (Cloudflare Worker, Phase 4)
worker/node_modules/
worker/.wrangler/
